{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/8f642b0fe560d4d9bb372faa58f839b1.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reopen and restore a Japanese rural Train Station. Repair, upgrade, and bring it back to life. Play solo or with friends in co-op as you manage services, welcome passengers, and uncover a cozy mystery hidden in the station\u2019s story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/945c35fea7f29d4e9f38d90b2fc4da08.poster.avif?t=1764626368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/945c35fea7f29d4e9f38d90b2fc4da08.webm?t=1764626368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/e546ec8244312502757d6f5c18cc17b7.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned countryside station once full of life now stands silent. Your task: reopen its doors, repair its facilities, and bring passengers back. As you rebuild, you\u2019ll encounter various NPC interactions, side quests, and tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/d4e05a040f853195a1f76b7cc679dd1a.poster.avif?t=1764626368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/d4e05a040f853195a1f76b7cc679dd1a.webm?t=1764626368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/8a583856de9cca6c601c4f3ef07f2c95.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the station manager, assigning tasks and handling daily operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with passengers and complete mini-quests to keep the station running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your week, manage resources, and upgrade facilities strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a relaxing, step-by-step management style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the station\u2019s daily operations solo or with friends in cooperative mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/99485b90cb74d305d03b4f9c6f49af13.poster.avif?t=1764626368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/99485b90cb74d305d03b4f9c6f49af13.webm?t=1764626368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/ed1dad3dad299734c7430ca2d30ef890.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stress-free, system-driven progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique NPCs and interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable station upgrades and equipment</p>